      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan \"two\" dalam subseksyen (1) dengan perkataan \"five\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/23/msa@/~cl_18__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/23/msa@/~cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan noktah di hujung subseksyen (3) dengan noktah bertindih dan memasukkan selepas itu proviso yang berikut: \"Provided that where the prohibition is conditional upon a licence being issued in respect of the import of such goods, a senior officer of customs may release such goods if a licence is subsequently issued by any relevant authority.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/23/msa@/~cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/23/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 138 Akta ibu adalah dipinda dengan mengganti-"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "kan perkataan \"four\" dengan perkataan \"five\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/23/msa@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/23/msa@/~cl_2__para_a",
